   "z": 41.5,
   "text": "NEW RAVENSPIRE \u2014 seat of the Shadow Legion. Founded by Seraphina after the Great Darkness. Inside: the Black Raven (inn), the Legion Armoury, the Map-Maker, the Guild Exchange. East gate: the road to the Obsidian Gate. South: the Great Rift \u2014 keep to the road."
  }
